e Fun.</h2></div><img src="/landing-page-files/65f1cda7de87d6943da9fa60_Lines.svg"alt=""class="section-lines"></div><div class="section call-section"><div class="container grid-2"><div id="w-node-_48f1e152-304c-af08-bac2-2094cbc0c067-3da9f9f2"class="column description-heading"><h2 class="max-600">Who can benefit from The Pond?</h2><p class="big-paragraph max-500">Whether you're learning the basics or refining specific skills, The Pond gives players ages 4 to 60+ a structured way to work on skating, puck control, shooting, and passing, wherever they train.</p><a href="#pricingSect" class="button membership-plans-button w-button">View membership plans</a>
